msgid ""
"data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append$//mod:findName[@name=\"ATLAS_EQUIPMENT\"]/mod-"
"append:choice[1]/text"
msgstr "（引擎超载Mk 5）使用电容器。"

#: src-en/data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append:14
msgid ""
"data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append$//mod:findName[@name=\"ATLAS_EQUIPMENT\"]/mod-"
"append:choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "你检查了电容器，发现可以校准其速度。你想跑得越快，就要承受越多的伤害。这个电容器只能使用一次。"

#: src-en/data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append:16
msgid ""
"data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append$//mod:findName[@name=\"ATLAS_EQUIPMENT\"]/mod-"
"append:choice[1]/event/choice[1]/text"
msgstr "最低速度。[使叛军追击延迟2次跃迁，引擎处引发一场火灾]"

#: src-en/data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append:18
msgid ""
"data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append$//mod:findName[@name=\"ATLAS_EQUIPMENT\"]/mod-"
"append:choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/text"
msgstr "你将电容器设置为尽可能最低的速度运行。虽然你的船体没有受到任何损伤，但引擎处引发了一场火灾。"

#: src-en/data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append:24
msgid ""
"data/events_special_lightspeed.xml.append$//mod:findName[@name=\"ATLAS_EQUIPMENT\"]/mod-"
"append:choice[1]/event/choice[1]/event/choice/text"
msgstr "继续。"

